# Undead Knight (Sargent, 2009)
# COMMUNITY / PERIOD DECK — not a MicroProse deck. Abe Sargent's "Modified" Undead Knight deck —
#   his improved build of the in-game enemy deck, from his StarCityGames column on Shandalar
#   (article date 2009-04-09).
# archetype: the Shandalar enemy "Undead Knight" deck, re-tuned within the Shandalar card pool
# designer: Abe Sargent
# year: 2009
# base: decks/1997/originals/undead_knight.deck — the enemy deck this re-tunes
# source: https://articles.starcitygames.com/articles/the-kitchen-table-280-black-shandalar-decks/
#   — The Kitchen Table #280 - Black Shandalar Decks — "Modified Undead Knight" [Tier-web — Abe
#   Sargent's "The Kitchen Table" column, StarCityGames; no local copy exists]
# cross-check: decks/1997/originals/undead_knight.deck [Tier 3 — his "Initial" (unmodified) list
#   differs from the shipped 1997 original by 2 cards (his transcription, or the later Manalink
#   file); the Modified list is shipped as he printed it]
# group: Community decks
name: Undead Knight (Sargent, 2009)
